    "name": "Seekers Alliance: Hero's Journey",
    "steam_appid": 1352890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8677cd8573d3ad85e6e9e7d5c2181261.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div><strong><i>Seekers Alliance: Hero\u2019s Journey</i></strong> is a fast-paced, roguelite card game and deck builder. Team up with a Hero from a diverse roster to explore the various zones of Sovereign\u2019s Island. Craft your decks and assemble your party to overcome the Sovereign\u2019s trials as you descend into the Island\u2019s depths to uncover its long-hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8edc1842a7ca8f81758b84270ea8915f.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/467a87e41979852c38a75c520cc99fc0.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To aid you on your quest (and pursue their own goals), Heroes from different Factions will fight by your side, each offering unique supporting abilities, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7b872667f5bec66d40717f5517d21aa1.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Van der Leck Family</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Van der Leck Family is a rising star in the Sea of Data. Members are impulsive, young, and ambitious, yet possess the cold ruthlessness and wisdom to see the big picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/d8be47e86e4bd59ef981fd86369967ca.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>House Galahad</strong><br>Members of House Galahad are skilled hackers, relentless dreamers, and the fearless pioneers who first ventured into the new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7a395ca66ca876c800151a5d2eb10453.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mahdia Alliance</strong><br>Mahdia Alliance is the guardian of ancient virtues, where blazing dragon flames accompany philosophers. It serves as the beacon that illuminates the path for all amidst the chaos of this new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fbf045500d36283c4fb3dcedc2ff1f62.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Seeker's Alliance</i>, players strategically deploy cards across three Zones: Attack, Speed, and Defense. Each card has its designated Zone, and outcomes in these Zones will determine the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/d322ff5b6c8baf66f110515a9be87c5a.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brute force isn\u2019t the only path to victory. Heroes skilled in guerrilla tactics can seize an advantage by winning the Speed Zone, while slow, heavy units can establish a strong defense in the Defense Zone and use counter-attacks to devastate opponents. Of course, if you\u2019d rather overwhelm your opponents with sheer power, you can prove once and for all that all strategies crumble when faced with absolute power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9cb062fb977dc0e58d73c60263bd3623.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Hero in the game comes equipped with their unique ultimate skill, not only offering powerful, game-changing effects but also showcasing the Hero's charm with customized animations. Whether it's a cunning strategy to turn the tides or the strongest shield that stops all damage, these ults will be the key to your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ae27c17c75605eb3daae8168ec5cd24d.poster.avif?t=1753942219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ae27c17c75605eb3daae8168ec5cd24d.webm?t=1753942219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/b12ad43381711e38bd6484cdcc878538.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Build Your Hero Squad: </strong>Recruit Heroes from different Factions to form your ultimate team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25a0 <strong>Relic System: </strong>Seek ancient relics scattered across the Island to unlock their hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>\u25a0 Deck Archives:</strong> Save your winning deck after each run. Your best builds won\u2019t just be a memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25a0 <strong>Final Boss Challenge: </strong>Use your archived decks to face the Island\u2019s strongest threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25a0 <strong>Even More Surprises Await: </strong>\u2026perhaps some mysterious visitors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/006ad608e096ff9ab9062f85a478ac63.poster.avif?t=1753942219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/006ad608e096ff9ab9062f85a478ac63.webm?t=1753942219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8677cd8573d3ad85e6e9e7d5c2181261.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div><strong><i>Seekers Alliance: Hero\u2019s Journey</i></strong> is a fast-paced, roguelite card game and deck builder. Team up with a Hero from a diverse roster to explore the various zones of Sovereign\u2019s Island. Craft your decks and assemble your party to overcome the Sovereign\u2019s trials as you descend into the Island\u2019s depths to uncover its long-hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/8edc1842a7ca8f81758b84270ea8915f.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/467a87e41979852c38a75c520cc99fc0.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To aid you on your quest (and pursue their own goals), Heroes from different Factions will fight by your side, each offering unique supporting abilities, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7b872667f5bec66d40717f5517d21aa1.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Van der Leck Family</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Van der Leck Family is a rising star in the Sea of Data. Members are impulsive, young, and ambitious, yet possess the cold ruthlessness and wisdom to see the big picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/d8be47e86e4bd59ef981fd86369967ca.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>House Galahad</strong><br>Members of House Galahad are skilled hackers, relentless dreamers, and the fearless pioneers who first ventured into the new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7a395ca66ca876c800151a5d2eb10453.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mahdia Alliance</strong><br>Mahdia Alliance is the guardian of ancient virtues, where blazing dragon flames accompany philosophers. It serves as the beacon that illuminates the path for all amidst the chaos of this new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/fbf045500d36283c4fb3dcedc2ff1f62.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Seeker's Alliance</i>, players strategically deploy cards across three Zones: Attack, Speed, and Defense. Each card has its designated Zone, and outcomes in these Zones will determine the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/d322ff5b6c8baf66f110515a9be87c5a.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brute force isn\u2019t the only path to victory. Heroes skilled in guerrilla tactics can seize an advantage by winning the Speed Zone, while slow, heavy units can establish a strong defense in the Defense Zone and use counter-attacks to devastate opponents. Of course, if you\u2019d rather overwhelm your opponents with sheer power, you can prove once and for all that all strategies crumble when faced with absolute power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9cb062fb977dc0e58d73c60263bd3623.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Hero in the game comes equipped with their unique ultimate skill, not only offering powerful, game-changing effects but also showcasing the Hero's charm with customized animations. Whether it's a cunning strategy to turn the tides or the strongest shield that stops all damage, these ults will be the key to your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ae27c17c75605eb3daae8168ec5cd24d.poster.avif?t=1753942219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ae27c17c75605eb3daae8168ec5cd24d.webm?t=1753942219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/b12ad43381711e38bd6484cdcc878538.avif?t=1753942219\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Build Your Hero Squad: </strong>Recruit Heroes from different Factions to form your ultimate team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25a0 <strong>Relic System: </strong>Seek ancient relics scattered across the Island to unlock their hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>\u25a0 Deck Archives:</strong> Save your winning deck after each run. Your best builds won\u2019t just be a memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25a0 <strong>Final Boss Challenge: </strong>Use your archived decks to face the Island\u2019s strongest threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25a0 <strong>Even More Surprises Await: </strong>\u2026perhaps some mysterious visitors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/006ad608e096ff9ab9062f85a478ac63.poster.avif?t=1753942219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/006ad608e096ff9ab9062f85a478ac63.webm?t=1753942219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
